        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55398995?u=9f6a9837c9879eceb0abde487a338b92d4e206fc&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Continuing <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5607833581\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45874\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/45874/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45874\">#45874</a> —this time focusing on property subpages. This particular PR deals with everything not related to HTML/DOM.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45875",
            "title": "Add \"read-only\" to property pages whose interfaces already use them (2)",
            "date_modified": "2026-09-28T01:05:29.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-09-28T01:03:35.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "Josh-Cena",
                "url": "https://github.com/Josh-Cena"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55398995?u=9f6a9837c9879eceb0abde487a338b92d4e206fc&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Continuing <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5607748789\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45873\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/45873/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45873\">#45873</a> —this time focusing on property subpages. This particular PR deals with HTML/DOM-related APIs.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45874",
            "title": "Add \"read-only\" to property pages whose interfaces already use them (1)",
            "date_modified": "2026-09-28T01:05:16.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-09-28T01:02:50.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "Josh-Cena",
                "url": "https://github.com/Josh-Cena"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55398995?u=9f6a9837c9879eceb0abde487a338b92d4e206fc&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">I don't know how dogmatic we are in enforcing that readonly properties are marked as readonly, but it's certainly a bug if a page is already using them and there exist readonly properties that aren't indicated as such, because then readers would assume that their absence means they are not readonly.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45873",
            "title": "Add missing ReadOnlyInline to pages that already use them",
            "date_modified": "2026-09-28T00:51:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-09-28T00:49:27.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "Josh-Cena",
                "url": "https://github.com/Josh-Cena"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55398995?u=9f6a9837c9879eceb0abde487a338b92d4e206fc&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">It might be okay for read-only properties to not be marked as such (our guidelines are murky) but it's never okay for non-readonly properties to be marked as such.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Namely:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Dictionaries are never readonly (<code class=\"notranslate\">MediaTrackSupportedConstraints</code>)</li>\n<li>Derived class members are protocols and can never be enforced as readonly (<code class=\"notranslate\">AudioWorkletProcessor.parameterDescriptors</code>)</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">...others are just typos. They have never been read-only.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45872",
            "title": "Remove read-only modifiers from properties that are not",
            "date_modified": "2026-09-28T00:42:24.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-09-28T00:40:42.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "Josh-Cena",
                "url": "https://github.com/Josh-Cena"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55398995?u=9f6a9837c9879eceb0abde487a338b92d4e206fc&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">These properties are never ever found in any browser. They might be typos, copy-paste errors, or simply a misunderstanding.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45871",
            "title": "Remove non-existent web API properties",
            "date_modified": "2026-09-28T00:36:09.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-09-28T00:32:05.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "Josh-Cena",
