        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55398995?u=9f6a9837c9879eceb0abde487a338b92d4e206fc&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Remove broken links as much as possible. If I removed a link, it's always because the original one is 404 or entire site is down.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">More context in comments.</p>",
