        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55398995?u=9f6a9837c9879eceb0abde487a338b92d4e206fc&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #26602.\">Fix</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"1697657759\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/26602\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/26602/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/26602\">#26602</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I decided to stay away from any service that may require sign-up; readers are expected to have a GH account, so this seems to have the least friction.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I also removed references to other APIs that are no longer public/free, including Mapquest and Twitter.</p>",
